<title>USA: Texaco wants 350 mln more authorized shares.</title>
<headline>Texaco wants 350 mln more authorized shares.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Inc said on Monday it will increase the number of authorized shares of common stock to 700 million shares from 350 million shares, and reduce the current $6.25 common share par value to $3.125, subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>The company said that while currently authorized shares are sufficient to meet all its presently known needs, the availability of the additional shares will enhance its flexibility for potential acquisitions, financings, stock dividends and other corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
